  "name": "Peacekeeper's M855A1 ammos",
  "slug": "peacekeepers-m855a1-ammos",
  "teaser": "Stop farming M855A1 from raiders and bosses, just buy them",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2083.webp",
  "downloads": 4157,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<h3>This mod will no longer be updated!</h3>\n<h3>Use this mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2151-high-tier-ammo-hta/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">High Tier Ammo (HTA)</a></h3>\n<h3>This mod reintroduces M855A1 ammo to the Peacekeeper trader. To keep the balance, I limited the ammo purchase to 120 rounds per restock and set the price at 8 dollars per ammo (1168 rubles), which corresponds to the price of high-tier ammo. Ammo available at LL4 trader</h3>\n<p>In the config.conf file you can set the price for ammo, the amount of ammo per restock and the trader’s loyalty level</p>\n<h3>Installation:</h3>\n<p>Move the <strong>user folder</strong> to SPT_folder</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/IeCDkMm.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IeCDkMm.png\" alt=\"IeCDkMm.png\" /></a></p>\n",
